`long long wideProduct=static_cast<long long>(left*right);` 在轉型前就以 int 計算乘法，可能先溢位。50000×50000 是 2500000000，超過 32-bit int，仍在 long long 範圍內；問題不是 long long 不夠大。應先提升一個運算元，再乘：`long long wideProduct=static_cast<long long>(left)*right;`。

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;
int main() {
    int left, right;
    while (cin >> left >> right) {
        long long wideProduct = static_cast<long long>(left) * right;
        cout << wideProduct << "\n";
    }
}
```
